{"3451980":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Soul's Remnant","steam_appid":3451980,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3451980\/extras\/632668698cf4ef1a5bd5a9daca4a09f9.avif?t=1786618773\" width=624 height=100 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul's Remnant is a free to play 2D platformer MMORPG by Chaomoon, with a focus on social gameplay and exploration. Customize your skills with our classless system, team up with others, and defeat monsters, bosses, and dungeons together!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the mysterious world of Soul's Remnant with friends or meet new ones along the way - just watch out when night falls!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3451980\/extras\/50ef855b75d4d7e11f3bcaac054c82a7.avif?t=1786618773\" width=800 height=180 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D platformer MMORPG<\/strong> with a cute and colorful pixel art graphics style<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large world to explore<\/strong> with lots of monsters, bosses, dungeons, and secrets to find!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classless skill system and<\/strong> <strong>various stats <\/strong>to build your character with<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of <strong>equipment<\/strong> of various rarities to find and upgrade<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging <strong>dungeons and bosses<\/strong> for your (and your friends) to conquer<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild system<\/strong> with various perks for you and your guild to unlock<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>crafting and gathering system<\/strong>, with many recipes to unlock and items to craft<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive <strong>quest system<\/strong> that provides various fun missions to complete for rewards<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend 10 villager NPCs and learn their stories!<\/strong> Each with their own unique personality<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of <strong>player-driven and party-based content<\/strong>, such as parties, party grinding, housing, and player shops for a full player-driven economy!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full soundtrack of 40+ originally composed songs, all written, composed, and produced by Chaomoon<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3451980\/extras\/c23896e927d75bfbf929abe19ad20aa8.avif?t=1786618773\" width=800 height=180 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by a small indie team!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Chaomoon! For 8 years (from 2016 to 2024), I developed Soul's Remnant alone as my passion project. Over years of hosting public playtests, the game developed a community of dedicated players, and grew to be something larger.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, working towards bigger and better versions of the game, the team has expanded, with Rajah joining the team since 2025 to help with future updates and development!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3451980\/extras\/ad15f69dd42e2247a5426198470e733d.avif?t=1786618773\" width=800 height=180 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developed with community in mind!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback has always been a crucial part of Soul's Remnant's development, so feel free to join our community and leave feedback for us, as we continuously work towards making the game even better!<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3451980\/extras\/632668698cf4ef1a5bd5a9daca4a09f9.avif?t=1786618773\" width=624 height=100 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul's Remnant is a free to play 2D platformer MMORPG by Chaomoon, with a focus on social gameplay and exploration. Customize your skills with our classless system, team up with others, and defeat monsters, bosses, and dungeons together!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the mysterious world of Soul's Remnant with friends or meet new ones along the way - just watch out when night falls!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3451980\/extras\/50ef855b75d4d7e11f3bcaac054c82a7.avif?t=1786618773\" width=800 height=180 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D platformer MMORPG<\/strong> with a cute and colorful pixel art graphics style<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large world to explore<\/strong> with lots of monsters, bosses, dungeons, and secrets to find!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classless skill system and<\/strong> <strong>various stats <\/strong>to build your character with<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of <strong>equipment<\/strong> of various rarities to find and upgrade<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging <strong>dungeons and bosses<\/strong> for your (and your friends) to conquer<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild system<\/strong> with various perks for you and your guild to unlock<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>crafting and gathering system<\/strong>, with many recipes to unlock and items to craft<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive <strong>quest system<\/strong> that provides various fun missions to complete for rewards<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend 10 villager NPCs and learn their stories!<\/strong> Each with their own unique personality<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of <strong>player-driven and party-based content<\/strong>, such as parties, party grinding, housing, and player shops for a full player-driven economy!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full soundtrack of 40+ originally composed songs, all written, composed, and produced by Chaomoon<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3451980\/extras\/c23896e927d75bfbf929abe19ad20aa8.avif?t=1786618773\" width=800 height=180 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by a small indie team!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Chaomoon! For 8 years (from 2016 to 2024), I developed Soul's Remnant alone as my passion project. Over years of hosting public playtests, the game developed a community of dedicated players, and grew to be something larger.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, working towards bigger and better versions of the game, the team has expanded, with Rajah joining the team since 2025 to help with future updates and development!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3451980\/extras\/ad15f69dd42e2247a5426198470e733d.avif?t=1786618773\" width=800 height=180 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developed with community in mind!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback has always been a crucial part of Soul's Remnant's development, so feel free to join our community and leave feedback for us, as we continuously work towards making the game even better!<\/p>","short_description":"Soul's Remnant is a 2D platformer MMORPG focused on social gameplay and exploration! Customize your character, and conquer dungeons and bosses in this mysterious world. Play with friends or make new ones - just watch out when night falls!","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Vietnamese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3451980\/header.jpg?t=1786618773","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3451980\/dfd0da1e7e3da81893c53d87e2e2905c03e54c56\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786618773","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3451980\/dfd0da1e7e3da81893c53d87e2e2905c03e54c56\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786618773","website":"https:\/\/soulsremnant.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7+<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Something within the last decade probably<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Anything that can make sound, probably<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<